"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Gentlemen."
},
{
"k": "8155",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "His considerable investment in Fabletown puts him in a unique position."
},
{
"k": "8156",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I modestly admit to having had a little bit of practice."
},
{
"k": "8157",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "He's also a concerned party when it comes to threats to the safety of the community."
},
{
"k": "8158",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Pride, my friend. In a job well done."
},
{
"k": "8159",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "He takes a little too much pleasure in his work."
},
{
"k": "8160",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Gentlemen, please! May I remind you that we need information from this, this brute! Bluebeard, has he said anything else?"
},
{
"k": "8161",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Cur! Ancient history. Shall we dredge up YOUR appetites as well?"
},
{
"k": "8162",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You think I should be in that chair."
},
{
"k": "8163",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "It crossed my mind. You usually marry them first, though, don't you?"
},
{
"k": "8164",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Nothing new, but it's only a matter of time."
},
{
"k": "8165",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Perhaps a different… implement?"
},
{
"k": "8166",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "There's no time for patience."
},
{
"k": "8167",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "It's not about the tools, it's about the technique."
},
{
"k": "8168",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You just need to have patience."
},
{
"k": "8169",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who knows how much longer we have before there's another death?"
},
{
"k": "8170",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Fine, if you think you can do better."
},
{
"k": "8171",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I'm taking over this interrogation, as of right now."
},
{
"k": "8172",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "This interrogation is over."
},
{
"k": "8173",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Why?"
},
{
"k": "8174",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I will not leave Snow White's killer on the loose when we can find him by continuing to question this subject!"
},
{
"k": "8175",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We haven't learned who he's working with."
},
{
"k": "8176",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You can't stop now. That's ridiculous."
},
{
"k": "8177",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Riding Hood…"
},
{
"k": "8178",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[sour]He's not even talking about either of our murders. He's telling us about what happened with Red Riding Hood, back in the Homelands."
},
{
"k": "8179",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I got some of it in the bar last night as well, though a little more clearly."
},
{
"k": "8180",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "But… he said \"I cut her up.\""
},
{
"k": "8181",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Ha ha ha ha!"
},
{
"k": "8182",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Your confession's a crock."
},
{
"k": "8183",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[sour]You may remember there was a wolf in that story, wearing an old lady's clothes."
},
{
"k": "8184",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You…"
},
{
"k": "8185",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Aha! Bufkin said you were down here."
},
{
"k": "8186",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Snow White?"
},
{
"k": "8187",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Snow! I knew you weren't dead."
},
{
"k": "8188",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "There seems to have been some confusion on that point recently, but no, I'm not.  [concerned]Someone else is, though."
},
{
"k": "8189",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We thought…"
},
{
"k": "8190",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[icy]Is that what you call it."
},
{
"k": "8191",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I've just exonerated the Woodsman."
},
{
"k": "8192",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You understand, we thought you were…"
},
{
"k": "8193",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Jesus Christ, you poor man."
},
{
"k": "8194",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "They found the body."
},
{
"k": "8195",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[angrily][to Crane]Get him a doctor, then have him released."
},
{
"k": "8196",
"who": "SNOW",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "And come with me."
},
{
"k": "8197",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Please, don't."
},
{
"k": "8198",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I'm scum."
},
{
"k": "8199",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "So pale and beautiful."
},
{
"k": "8200",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "It was wrong, I know."
},
{
"k": "8201",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I was drunk."
},
{
"k": "8202",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I already said."
},
{
"k": "8203",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I can't."
},
{
"k": "8204",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I'm sorry, I'm so sorry."
},
{
"k": "8205",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What? No! We're not finished here."
},
{
"k": "8206",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Let an expert apply his skills."
},
{
"k": "8207",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "This cretin can't hold out much longer."
},
{
"k": "8208",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Bluebeard did get him to admit to dismembering the first victim…"
},
{
"k": "8209",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I said we're done, that means we're done. End of discussion."
},
{
"k": "8210",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I do not accept your authority!"
},
{
"k": "8211",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "If you want out, fine."
},
{
"k": "8212",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You always did lack stomach."
},
{
"k": "8213",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "But I mean to continue until I am satisfied!"
},
{
"k": "8214",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Fine. Have it your way. I can't wait to see who winds up dead next."
},
{
"k": "8215",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[menacing, wolf-like growl]"
},
{
"k": "8216",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "No more. Please."
},
{
"k": "8217",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[cough cough cough]"
},
{
"k": "8218",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[whimpers]…oh God, oh…"
},
{
"k": "8219",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[retches]"
},
{
"k": "8220",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[wailing softly]Aaaa, haaa, I'm talk, I'm hab, ha."
},
{
"k": "8221",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[coughs and has trouble catching his breath, gasping]"
},
{
"k": "8222",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Fa. Fa. Fuck. Aa."
},
{
"k": "8223",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[soft whimper]…aaaa…"
},
{
"k": "8224",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Maybe not…"
},
{
"k": "8225",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[doubtful grunt]"
},
{
"k": "8226",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Make up your mind already!"
},
{
"k": "8227",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "There's a killer out there planning his next move while you're pussyfooting around in here."
},
{
"k": "8228",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I made a plan, but it didn't work."
},
{
"k": "8229",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "No kidding."
},
{
"k": "8230",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What was your plan?"
},
{
"k": "8231",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "When I was ready, I would break in. Wrong place, wrong time."
},
{
"k": "8232",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What happened when you broke in?"
},
{
"k": "8233",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I had the axe with me. I didn't know if I would use it. The woman was gone."
},
{
"k": "8234",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Did you kill her?"
},
{
"k": "8235",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Did you kill her!"
},
{
"k": "8236",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I tried, I cut her up…"
},
{
"k": "8237",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "We've already been through this, you're wasting time."
},
{
"k": "8238",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I cut her up, but under the dress…oh, no."
},
{
"k": "8239",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You were with me. How do you explain that?"
},
{
"k": "8240",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I was with you."
},
{
"k": "8241",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who are you working with?"
},
{
"k": "8242",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I only… my best friend. Only one I trust."
},
{
"k": "8243",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "My axe."
},
{
"k": "8244",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who is your best friend?"
},
{
"k": "8245",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Oh, for heaven's sake. This isn't getting us anywhere."
},
{
"k": "8246",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Where is the axe now? What did you do with it?"
},
{
"k": "8247",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "It's gone, I don't know."
},
{
"k": "8248",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who else is involved?"
},
{
"k": "8249",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You, you were there."
},
{
"k": "8250",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who else was really there?"
},
{
"k": "8251",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "The girl, with the coat."
},
{
"k": "8252",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Tell me about the girl with the coat."
},
{
"k": "8253",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I went there, it should have been easy, the two of them."
},
{
"k": "8254",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "The women were together?"
},
{
"k": "8255",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "The girl with the coat went to see the older one."
},
{
"k": "8256",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Red, red, so much red."
},
{
"k": "8257",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[suspicious]What color was the coat?"
},
{
"k": "8258",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Boring!"
},
{
"k": "8259",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I needed money."
},
{
"k": "8260",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Hush."
},
{
"k": "8261",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Did you rob them?"
},
{
"k": "8262",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I wanted to. But I couldn't."
},
{
"k": "8263",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Why her?"
},
{
"k": "8264",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Convenient. Easy."
},
{
"k": "8265",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What about the other woman?"
},
{
"k": "8266",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Easy, she was supposed to be easy. No protection."
},
{
"k": "8267",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Where is the body?"
},
{
"k": "8268",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "The river! I threw it in the river…"
},
{
"k": "8269",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What do the women have in common?"
},
{
"k": "8270",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "The house. The little one brought gifts."
},
{
"k": "8271",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "What kind of gifts did the woman bring?"
},
{
"k": "8272",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I didn't see. They smelled nice"
},
{
"k": "8273",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "You used the axe?"
},
{
"k": "8274",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Yes, yes, the axe."
},
{
"k": "8275",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who's behind this?"
},
{
"k": "8276",
"who": "CRANE",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Now see here, this is preposterous!"
},
{
"k": "8277",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "[looking crazily at Crane]Him! You know!"
},
{
"k": "8278",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "He gives the orders!"
},
{
"k": "8279",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Easy, Crane."
},
{
"k": "8280",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Who's behind the killings?"
},
{
"k": "8281",
"who": "WOODSMAN",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "I tried, I tried."
},
{
"k": "8282",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "pft! [rolls his eyes]"
},
{
"k": "8283",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Oh come on. You're not even trying!"
},
{
"k": "8284",
"who": "BIGBY",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "When I want your advice, I'll ask for it."
},
{
"k": "8285",
"who": "BLUEBEARD",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "If you don't apply a little pain, he's not going to give you anything. I'm frankly surprised to find you so civilized."
},
{
"k": "8286",
"who": "",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "Fine, go ahead."
},
{
"k": "8287",
"who": "*IF YOU APPLY FORCE AFTER HAVING GOTTEN A VAGUE ANSWE R, YOU'LL REASK THE CURRENT QUESTION (AUTOMATICALLY, THOUGH WE DON'T HAVE TO DO THAT IF PEOPLE DON'T LIKE IT). THIS TIME YOU'LL GET A MORE FOCUSED ANSWER, LIKE, \"DID YOU KILL HER!\"",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "\"I cut her up, but under the dress…oh, no.\" \n*The effects of force last for a beat, so you can smack the Woodsman and THEN ask a question, and you'll also get a \"good\" answer in that case.\n*Some of the physical things you can do to the Woodsman are clearly more extreme than others. They won't get you a better answer, but their effects last longer in terms of the Woodsman's focus.\n*If you're just asking the questions while Bluebeard handles the physical end, Bluebeard will be doing something physical at every beat.  The effect on the Woodsman is the same as if you were doing it yourself."
},
{
"k": "8288",
"who": "*IF YOU PICK A QUESTION THAT SUPPLIES ITS OWN ANSWER, LIKE, \"YOU WENT TO HER APARTMENT, DIDN'T YOU!\" THEN THE WOODSMAN'S UNDERDURESS ANSWER WILL FEED THIS STRAIGHT BACK TO YOU",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "\"I went to her apartment.\" You won't learn anything interesting with this kind of question, he'll just say whatever you tell him to.\n*Some questions will unlock follow-up questions, and if you ask the right stuff you just might figure out what's really going on (Woodsman is a mess and is confusing this questioning with other things he feels guilty about)."
},
{
"k": "8289",
"who": "NOTES",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "After some initial dialog-based questioning, you are released to reticle mode (and possibly freewalk).  From here you can Talk To the Woodsman to continue a linear line of questioning.  You can also Hurt the Woodsman in various ways."
},
{
"k": "8290",
"who": "IF YOU ASK A QUESTION WITHOUT USING FORCE, WOODSMAN GIVES YOU A VAGUE, BABBLY ANSWER LIKE, \"DID YOU KILL SNOW WHITE?\"",
"ctx": "Fables102/env_fabletown_woodlandscell",
"en": "\"Please,\" or \"I don't know,\" or \"I'm sorry.\"  These are pulled from a generic list."
},
